## Stadiums

Stadium identities, location and recorded capacity.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| stadium_id | Stadium ID | string | Stable stadium identifier; join using this value. | stadium_id |
| stadium_name | Stadium Name | string | Recorded stadium name. | stadium_name |
| city_name | City Name | string | Recorded city name. | city_name |
| country_name | Country Name | string | Recorded country name. | country_name |
| stadium_capacity | Stadium Capacity | integer | Recorded stadium capacity; not an estimate of match attendance. | stadium_capacity |
| stadium_wikipedia_link | Stadium Wikipedia Link | string | Wikipedia reference for stadium. | stadium_wikipedia_link |
| city_wikipedia_link | City Wikipedia Link | string | Wikipedia reference for city. | city_wikipedia_link |

### Keys

Primary Keys: key_id
Display Key: stadium_name
